  10914                                                                                                                      010003
  10915  *                                                                                                                   010004
  10916  * If the current turnaround number already has its own HYPINTR record,                                              010005
  10917  * check its release status to determine whether it is on intransit                                                  010006
  10918  * hold.                                                                                                             010007
  10919  *                                                                                                                   010008
  10920 C                   IF        wk_Turn# <> *Zero                                                 B02                  010009
  10921 C     key_IO        CHAIN     HYPINTR                                                            02                  010010
  10922 C                   IF        %found(HYPINTR)                                                   B03                  010011
  10923 C                   IF        IORLSD = *Zero                                                    B04                  010012
  10924 C                   EVAL      wk_OnIntrHold = *ON                                                04                  010013
  10925 C                   ENDIF                                                  IORLSD=*Zero         E04                  010014
  10926 C                   LEAVE                                                                        03                  010015
  10927 C                   ENDIF                                                  %found(HYPINTR)      E03                  010016
  10928 C                   ENDIF                                                  wk_Turn#<>*Zero      E02                  010017
  10929                                                                                                                      010018
  10930  *                                                                                                                   010019
  10931  * If the current turnaround number does not yet have its own HYPINTR                                                010020
  10932  * record, check for any other record for the order that has an order-                                               010021
  10933  * level hold type and that has not yet been invoiced.  If any found,                                                010022
  10934  * the order, and thus this turnaround, is on intransit hold.                                                        010023
